@startuml
actor User
participant System
participant ReservationService
participant Classroom
participant TimeSlot
participant Reservation

User -> System: login(username, password)
System --> User: User object

User -> ReservationService: browseAvailableClassrooms(date)
ReservationService -> Classroom: getAvailableTimeSlots(date)
Classroom -> TimeSlot: checkAvailability()
TimeSlot --> Classroom: available slots list
Classroom --> ReservationService: classroom list with slots
ReservationService --> User: available classroom list

User -> ReservationService: selectClassroom(classroomId)
ReservationService -> Classroom: getAvailableTimeSlots(date)
Classroom --> ReservationService: available time slots
ReservationService --> User: time slot list

User -> ReservationService: selectTimeSlot(classroomId, slot)
ReservationService -> TimeSlot: isAvailable()
TimeSlot --> ReservationService: boolean

alt slot is available
  ReservationService -> Reservation: create(userId, classroomId, slot)
  Reservation --> ReservationService: success
  ReservationService --> User: reservation success
else slot not available
  ReservationService --> User: reservation failed
end
@enduml